\[
(1-O(\delta_{x}))I\preceq g^{\frac{1}{2}}g'^{-1}g^{\frac{1}{2}}\preceq(1+O(\delta_{x}))I.
\]
Thus $-O(\delta_{x})I\preceq I-g^{\frac{1}{2}}g'^{-1}g^{\frac{1}{2}}\preceq O(\delta_{x})I$.
